Z||000013||Fformula88||09-27-2001||11:26 AM||||Doesn't look as European to me as it does look like a long line of cheap Ford econo-boxes... Ford Fiesta (the old one sold here!) Ford Escort hatch, Ford Aspire etc etc.<P>I have nothing against performance pocket rockets, but if I am going to own a performance car it is also gonna look like one... and no tacking on ricer wings, gfx and decals doesn't make ti look like one in my book!<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero2m6siga.JPG">       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <P>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
