Z||000016||DaRkLoRD||09-29-2001||01:14 AM||||yeah, if you can ignore the sound they make at 6,000 RPM, the funny looking interior, the 2 feet of head room above you.. (I'm 6'3"...) and the fact that the damn car's so high...<P>it's got aa bit of power. The rental one we have has got the 130hp "Zetec" (nah, not a ripoff of the VTEC name.. hehe)<BR>today I actually had to let off the gas cause I was going too fast after passing someone, I hate to say it, but that little car really wanted to GO.... hehe<BR>ah well, they're now looking at Impalas, last I heard.. after driving this thing for 3 days my dad's been calling it "the scooter", and making jokes about it having hamsters in the engine compartment.. LOL.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||12
